-- seed.sql — Reference product catalog for RetailTrove.
-- This file contains 33 INSERT statements for the `products` table.
-- It is intended as a failsafe / backup for seeding a fresh production instance.
--
-- Usage:
--   supabase db query --file migrations/seed.sql
--
-- Notes:
--   - featured / new_arrival flags are derived from insertion order (indices 0-32).
--   - stock_quantity is set to 50 for all items.
--   - approval_status defaults to 'approved' so products are visible immediately.
--   - image URLs point to Unsplash source images; replace with production assets.

